{"id":"sc_concept_atomic_orbital","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_orbitals"],"name_zh":"原子轨道","name_en":"atomic orbital","summary_zh":"描述核外电子空间运动状态的波函数；高中阶段重点掌握轨道类型、取向与容纳电子规则。","teaching_priority":"core","facts":{"orbital_capacity_electrons":2},"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_nist_asd"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_pauli_principle","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_electron_configuration"],"name_zh":"泡利不相容原理","name_en":"Pauli exclusion principle","summary_zh":"同一原子中不存在四个量子数完全相同的两个电子；同一轨道最多容纳两个自旋相反的电子。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_hund_rule","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_electron_configuration"],"name_zh":"洪特规则","name_en":"Hund rule","summary_zh":"等价轨道上电子优先单独占据且自旋平行，达到半充满、全充满等状态时常表现出额外稳定性。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_aufbau","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_electron_configuration"],"name_zh":"能量最低原理","name_en":"Aufbau principle","summary_zh":"基态原子核外电子通常按轨道能量由低到高填充；具体基态排布以实验事实为准，不能把简化能级顺序当成绝对公式。","teaching_priority":"core","common_misconceptions":["把经验填充顺序当成对所有原子都无例外的绝对定律。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_nist_asd"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_valence_electron","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_periodic_structure_relation"],"name_zh":"价电子","name_en":"valence electron","summary_zh":"与元素化学性质和成键密切相关的外层或价层电子；不同元素区的价电子判定需结合电子排布。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_chemical_bond","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_bonding"],"name_zh":"化学键","name_en":"chemical bond","summary_zh":"使原子或原子团形成具有相对稳定结构实体的相互作用。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_covalent_bond","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_covalent_bond"],"name_zh":"共价键","name_en":"covalent bond","summary_zh":"由原子间电子共享相关的高电子密度区产生稳定吸引作用的化学键。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_sigma_bond","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_sigma_pi"],"name_zh":"σ键","name_en":"sigma bond","summary_zh":"沿成键原子核连线方向具有圆柱对称特征的成键相互作用；单键通常包含一个σ键。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_pi_bond","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_sigma_pi"],"name_zh":"π键","name_en":"pi bond","summary_zh":"由平行轨道侧向重叠形成、电子密度主要分布在核间轴两侧的成键相互作用；双键和三键中除σ键外含π键。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_bond_polarity","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_bond_polarity"],"name_zh":"键的极性","name_en":"bond polarity","summary_zh":"异核共价键中共享电子对偏向程度不同导致的电荷分布不均；不能仅凭键极性直接判断整个分子极性。","teaching_priority":"core","common_misconceptions":["含极性键的分子必定是极性分子。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_vsepr","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_vsepr"],"name_zh":"价层电子对互斥模型","name_en":"VSEPR model","summary_zh":"用中心原子价层成键电子对和孤电子对之间的排斥近似预测主族分子或离子的空间构型。","teaching_priority":"core","teaching_notes":["这是预测模型，不是从第一性原理唯一决定几何的完整理论。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_hybridization","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_hybridization"],"name_zh":"杂化轨道模型","name_en":"hybridization","summary_zh":"用原子轨道线性组合形成取向合适的等价或近似等价杂化轨道来解释局部成键与几何的教学模型。","teaching_priority":"common","teaching_notes":["不要把杂化当作先发生的物理步骤或唯一真实电子结构。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_molecular_polarity","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_molecular_polarity"],"name_zh":"分子极性","name_en":"molecular polarity","summary_zh":"分子整体正、负电荷中心是否重合及偶极矩是否为零的宏观描述，受键极性和空间构型共同影响。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_dispersion_force","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_intermolecular_forces"],"name_zh":"色散力","name_en":"London dispersion force","summary_zh":"由瞬时和诱导偶极产生的分子间吸引作用，广泛存在于原子和分子之间。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_dipole_dipole","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_intermolecular_forces"],"name_zh":"偶极—偶极作用","name_en":"dipole-dipole interaction","summary_zh":"永久偶极分子之间由取向相关静电作用产生的分子间作用力。","teaching_priority":"common","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_hydrogen_bond","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_intermolecular_forces"],"name_zh":"氢键","name_en":"hydrogen bond","summary_zh":"含氢供体与电负性原子受体之间具有方向性的特定相互作用；可存在于分子间或分子内。","teaching_priority":"core","common_misconceptions":["把氢键当作普通共价键。","认为任何含氢分子都能形成典型氢键。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_unit_cell","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_crystal_basics"],"name_zh":"晶胞","name_en":"unit cell","summary_zh":"用于通过平移重复描述晶体结构的基本重复单位；晶胞的选择和晶体结构的实际最小化学式不是同一概念。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_iucr","sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_molecular_crystal","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_molecular_crystal"],"name_zh":"分子晶体","name_en":"molecular crystal","summary_zh":"晶格节点的主要结构单元是分子，单元间主要由分子间作用力维系的晶体教学类别。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_iucr"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_covalent_crystal","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_covalent_crystal"],"name_zh":"共价晶体","name_en":"covalent network crystal","summary_zh":"原子通过延展的共价键网络形成的晶体，典型例子包括金刚石、晶体硅和二氧化硅网络结构。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_iucr"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_ionic_crystal","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_ionic_crystal"],"name_zh":"离子晶体","name_en":"ionic crystal","summary_zh":"由阳离子、阴离子按一定空间方式排列并由静电作用维系的晶体。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020","sc_src_iucr"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_metallic_crystal","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_metallic_crystal"],"name_zh":"金属晶体","name_en":"metallic crystal","summary_zh":"金属原子/离子实与离域电子共同形成的晶体结构教学模型，用于解释导电、导热、延展性等性质。","teaching_priority":"core","source_refs":["sc_src_cn_curriculum_2020"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_coordination","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_coordinate_bond"],"name_zh":"配位键/配位作用","name_en":"coordination","summary_zh":"Lewis 碱向 Lewis 酸提供电子对形成共价键的描述；成键后不应把电子来源误当作该键永久不同于普通共价键的本质标签。","teaching_priority":"common","common_misconceptions":["认为配位键形成后始终是一类与普通共价键本质完全不同的键。"],"source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_ligand","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_complexes"],"name_zh":"配体","name_en":"ligand","summary_zh":"在配位实体中与中心原子或离子发生配位的原子、离子或分子。","teaching_priority":"common","source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook"],"status":"reviewed"}
{"id":"sc_concept_coordination_number","record_type":"concept","topic_refs":["sc_topic_complexes","sc_topic_crystal_basics"],"name_zh":"配位数","name_en":"coordination number","summary_zh":"表示中心原子周围直接配位原子数或晶体中最近邻配位数的计数概念；具体含义必须结合上下文。","teaching_priority":"common","source_refs":["sc_src_iupac_goldbook","sc_src_iucr"],"status":"reviewed"}
